    story += bullet_list(['apiClient: token injection, redaction-safe logging, error normalization and retry policy.','sessionStore: user, role, organisation and signaturePinRequired; no PIN persistence.','syncEngine: encrypted mutation queue, cursor checkpointing and conflict handlers.','evidenceCapture: signature pad, consent rendering and immutable snapshot review.','uploadManager: file validation, resumable state and processing-status polling.','domain stores: projects, time, safety, plant, commercial, payroll and notifications.'])
